Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?D738=201.5=20(D667,=20=C2=A7110.5):=20a=20repea?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ted=20need=20on=20the=20connector=20shows=20the=20plan=20that?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20waits=20for=20the=20yes?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

create_task on the connector found the goal already open and answered only
its ref, title and status, so a plan proposed and not yet approved was lost
from sight. When the open goal has a proposed plan, already_open now carries
waiting_plan — the app's one sentence and its question, in the goal's own
language — and next says to show it again and ask for the yes. The two
texts are D738 1.5's, word for word; without a waiting plan the answer is
exactly what it was.

